#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:2
msgid "*FIRST* Tech Challenge Team Discounts"
msgstr "*FIRST* Tech Challenge チーム割引"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:4
msgid ""
"As a benefit of being a *FIRST* Tech Challenge Team, some vendors and "
"sponsors of *FIRST* programs have generously provided discounts on "
"products to teams. These discounts may be for specific categories of "
"products, or may apply site-wide, and may require an application process "
"or a season-specific or team-specific promo code. Read details below for "
"each vendor for more information."
msgstr ""
"*FIRST* Tech Challenge チームであることの特典として、*FIRST* プログラムの一部のベンダーや"
"スポンサーが製品の割引を提供しています。これらの割引は特定のカテゴリの製品に適用されるものや"
"サイト全体に適用されるものがあり、申請プロセスやシーズン固有・チーム固有のプロモーションコードが"
"必要な場合もあります。各ベンダーの詳細については下記をご覧ください。"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:12
msgid "Team Grant Opportunities"
msgstr "チームグラント機会"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:22
#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:44
msgid "**What**:"
msgstr "**内容**："

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:24
msgid "FIRST Tech Challenge Team Grants"
msgstr "FIRST Tech Challenge チームグラント"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:26
msgid "**Expires**: See each individual grant opportunity."
msgstr "**有効期限**：各グラント機会をご確認ください。"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:28
msgid ""
"**To Apply**: Check out the `list of current Team Grants available "
"<https://www.firstinspires.org/programs/team-grant-opportunities>`_ and "
"see if you're eligible!"
msgstr ""
"**申請方法**：`現在利用可能なチームグラントの一覧 "
"<https://www.firstinspires.org/programs/team-grant-opportunities>`_ を確認し、"
"資格があるか確認してください！"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:34
msgid "*FIRST* Storefront"
msgstr "*FIRST* ストアフロント"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:46
msgid ""
"All *FIRST* Tech Challenge Teams are eligible for discounts on control "
"equipment, electronics, and starter kits."
msgstr "すべての *FIRST* Tech Challenge チームはコントロール機器、電子部品、スターターキットの割引を受ける資格があります。"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:48
msgid "Teams are limited to one purchase per item per category each season."
msgstr "チームは各シーズン、各カテゴリのアイテムにつき1回の購入に限定されます。"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Expires**: Good for the current *FIRST* Tech Challenge competition "
"season."
msgstr "**有効期限**：現在の *FIRST* Tech Challenge 競技シーズン中有効。"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:52
msgid "**Promo Code**: N/A"
msgstr "**プロモーションコード**：なし"

#: ../../source/sponsors/discounts/discounts.rst:54
msgid ""
"**To Use**: See the `Kit of Parts PDF "
"<https://www.firstinspires.org/hubfs/web/program/ftc/ftc-storefront-"
"options.pdf>`_ for instructions on how to purchase discounted parts."
msgstr ""
"**使用方法**：割引パーツの購入方法については `Kit of Parts PDF "
"<https://www.firstinspires.org/hubfs/web/program/ftc/ftc-storefront-"
"options.pdf>`_ をご参照ください。"

